WEBVTT

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:09.570
Shizurin!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.490
We'll draw their attention, Just get out of here!

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.370
What are you talking about?

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:19.170
I can't possibly leave you two alone
to deal with these monsters.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.500
Rainbow Dragon Palm I, Sound Claw!

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:25.590
Magnificent!

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.430
We didn't come to this island just to fool around.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.810
We'll be fine, so...

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:35.720
Yeah!

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.020
I'll leave it to you then!

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:18.240
You're finally here, Order the End.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.290
You're not gonna hide behind
your nasty mask again, huh?

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.250
The name is Izea Nyos.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.960
What a traitor, Daughter of Castiella.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.040
Why are you calling me, a traitor?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.630
Don't think highly of yourself.

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:32.510
That outfit you're wearing is the traitor's identity.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:36.640
Wasn't it Gisella Paladiness'
who ordered to exterminate Ogres?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.180
Show your wrath, Radia!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.230
White hair is a symbol of royalty in the Ogre clan.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.230
And you there appear as a
member who extirpate our kind—

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.030
How dare you wield our sacred Hauras!?

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:59.080
Gisella indeed had very questionable method of propagating their belief.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.410
But, their belief was not in the wrong.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.410
And I believe it never was.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.790
Long ago before the Holy
Ground Treaty comes into effect.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.210
Only Gisela saw humanity and demon-kind as equals.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:16.260
Even if they were persecuted, They adhered to it—

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:18.260
and were determined to face any consequences.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.600
That's why the Ogre King entrusted Hauras to Gisella.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:28.150
"Luminance Fangs who shineth the darkness—"

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:31.020
"Blazing Gust purgeth thee, the evildoers"

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.320
"In thy name, flame devouring serpent."

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:38.360
"bestowed upon thee, a soul of saint,
For thou art imperishable blade."

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.210
Why didn't you kill me, already?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:55.010
As the Gisella's Paladiness,
That's not something I'd do.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:59.340
If you no longer mean harm,
Then please just stay out of my way.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.010
What are you do—?

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:05.980
Order the End.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.770
They're still around?

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:11.190
No. He's not with Order the End.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:15.110
The chief of Magna
Ataraxia Research (MAR)...

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:16.900
Shafriar Ren.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.000
I'm here to pick you up...

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.250
Dear Sis.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.630
Sekkarou!

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:41.140
Hear me out, Himeragi Yukina.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.390
I have no reason to fight you.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:44.720
Yukina.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:49.890
Don't worry, I'll make sure to
bring you to Akatsuki.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.940
Well if that's the case.
How unfortunate!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:58.030
"Enku of the Aurora, Qilin of radiant light..."

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.320
"Lords of heavenly chants and thunder..."

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.570
"With thy blazing wrath..."

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.450
"may thou cometh upon
to striketh down our fiends!"

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.340
Der Freischütz's magical bullets...

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:15.670
It must be Kirasaka!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.760
I made it in time.
Are you alright, Yukina?

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.430
Thank you very much, Sayaka.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.930
But how come you arrive in Itogami Island?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.430
Airport is unavailable, right?

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.310
Well... We can discuss that later.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.480
More importantly, who summoned that familiar?

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:35.060
That can't be that little kid over there, right?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.360
Little kid?

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:39.030
That's true, that kid was the one who did it.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.620
The Blood's getting smaller...?

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.740
Could it be the side effect of summoning familiars?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.910
Ghastly, right?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.580
Kenon.

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:55.880
Fall Gazer!

00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:02.220
Dodekatos will eventually show up
if I push her far enough, right?

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.680
Push enough!?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:08.010
It can't be, Is that the reason why
you ordered me to kill Avrora?

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:12.640
I don't wish to end this Lord's war soon.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.060
I thought by keeping you alive would benefit me.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.150
But the reality begs to differ.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:23.030
Kenon, you're unfortunately a defective product.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.410
You exhibit no proper control
over your emotional outbursts.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.830
That's a big no for prototype.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.960
Come forth, Primus Cinereus!

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:37.710
He ran away?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.250
Aerodyne!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.130
Avrora?

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.050
Where are you, Avrora?!

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.600
How unfortunate, but it's not a big deal.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:55.390
Kenon won't be able to go
anywhere far from here.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.190
For now...

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:02.150
It's all up to you, Fourth Progenitor.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.410
Keystone Gate?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.000
Kasuko! Hey, Hang in there!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:13.950
Kasuko!

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:17.710
My name is Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.710
Who the heck is Kasuko?

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:21.300
Are you all right?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.880
Of course. I have the paladiness' charm.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.390
You saw it, right?

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.680
You're the one who put it on display!

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.890
Anyway, I'm glad you're all good.

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:39.520
Ah, was she the one who attacked you?

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:46.780
Not quite, she actually protected me from
Shafriar Ren's Ambush, the MAR's Chief...

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:48.740
I'm still alive because of her.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.370
Shafriar...? For real?

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:56.540
So was he also the one who destroyed
the sentry pods and tanks here?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.460
Well about that...

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.130
There's still more?
get a load of this!

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.130
Storm Breaker Axe!

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.680
You're the one who escaped
from Natsuki's Prison.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.890
Huh?

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:15.100
Who's askin'? You can't possibly
be the real Fourth Progenitor, right?

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:18.020
What are you gonna do, huh?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.520
Why were you at the Keystone Gate?

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:24.690
I'm in search of that damn Shafriar.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:29.780
That damn Witch of the Void temporarily
grant me special privileges, exactly for that.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:33.950
That would be Shafriar Ren, the chief of MAR?

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.000
A Chief, huh?

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:40.080
For a scoundrel, he sure does have a great title.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.080
Scoundrel?

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:46.510
Yeah, He is also a Tenbu's Survivor, Just like me.

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.510
Tenbu?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.630
as in "Demigod" from the ancient civilization, right?

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:51.930
You were there?

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.310
Huh, what's wrong with that?

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:57.890
As comrades of Tenbu,
why do you want to kill him?

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:00.810
Didn't I tell you before? He's a scoundrel!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:04.860
As a Tenbu descendant's, He stole our "legacy" and decided to hide it here on this island.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:08.440
I've been on his tail for a while to retrieve it.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:13.120
Well, after killing those guys who stood in my way—

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:16.200
I've already become a criminal before I could realize it.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.410
What is "Tenbu Legacy"?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.000
Huh?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:24.080
Well... U-Uh... That's a piece of powerful magic tool.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:28.340
That being said, It's clearly a restricted
information for commoners like you.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.590
Speaking for yourself, huh?

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.260
Shut up, you idiot, you idiot!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.100
Tch! I'm outta here!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.140
Try not to get in my way,
the Fourth Progenitor.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:39.850
If you do, I'll kick yer ass!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:43.310
What's up with him? How vulgar!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.690
Aside from that, He could be telling the truth.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.280
MAR's company sudden popularity
as a magic weapons supplier—

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.450
And the use of Tenbu's technology
being rumored in their circle.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:10:00.500
That could be one of the reasons why the chief
of MAR has a connection with The Blood.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.920
The Blood?... You're right.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:08.300
D-Dragon?

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:10.260
Wait, Kasuko! Those are...

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.300
Senior!

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.220
Akatsuki Kojou! Are you still alive?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.510
Himeragi... Kirasaka...,
and Avrora?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.640
She was taken away by The Blood.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:23.230
Sorry, Senior. I'm...

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:25.650
No! It wasn't Yukina's fault.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:28.110
She already did her best
to protect Avrora Florestina.

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:28.980
Da!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.030
Wait, I'm completely lost here.

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:34.200
Anyway, Avrora is with The Blood, right?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:39.620
Yes. According to the Second Progenitor,
He probably headed to the Keystone Gate.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.910
Isn't that good news?
It'll be easier for us to act now.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.330
We'll rescue Avrora and end this war in one go.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.960
That's the best course of action.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.130
Senior...

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.920
Kasuko, you should bring
that person back with you.

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.010
Let's hope Uncle Kanase can still save her.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.720
Glenda, I'm counting on you.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:10:59.260
Da!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.600
Himeragi, Kirasaka,
Now we—

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.310
Kojou.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:09.730
K-Kasuko?

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:13.940
I've just blessed you with paladiness' charm—

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.280
You should be grateful.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.610
R-Right.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.250
Akatsuki Kojou, Who is that girl?

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.500
Why did she k-kiss you?

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:31.800
Kiss, huh? She was just
blessing me with "a charm".

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.710
If "her charm" is only a sham—

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.800
I'm going to gut you alive!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.720
All that for "her charm"? You're mad!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.050
Himeragi, at least say something.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:41.600
That reminds me...

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.270
Why were you at Keystone Gate in the first place?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:49.730
What would you do if Scorched Banquet
happened because of your actions there?

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.440
Send your complaints to Kasuko.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.990
It's not like I wanted to be there by my choice.

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.030
Got no choice, huh?

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:01.910
Let's say if Avrora's sacrifice went to waste...

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:03.370
Could you still shrug it off?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.750
I thought Avrora would be fine, if I left her in your care.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:14.630
But I was actually ordered to kill Avrora.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.880
That must've come from either
Nyanko-sensei or the Lion King Organization.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.800
Himeragi I know would never do something like that.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.510
Senior...

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.520
Besides, Kirasaka here can
vouch for you too, right?

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:32.190
W-Well, that's true.
If that's what you really think.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.110
It's alright. I won't let the scorched banquet happen...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.070
and Avrora won't disappear either.

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:41.240
But Himeragi, if I ever lose control of my familiars...

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.160
I want you to kill me.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.200
Senior?

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:48.790
I believe that's your job
as an observer, right?

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:51.710
Nagisa, Yaze and all my friends at school.

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:54.670
Instead of taking everyone's memories,

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:56.710
It's better if I just drop dead.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.220
I'm counting on you.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.470
I... I'm...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.220
You don't have to worry about it.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.850
I will never let such thing happens.

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:17.190
For just a few days, you seem to shrink a lot. The Blood.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.900
Now, if you wish to hand over
Avrora and apologize to us—

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.950
There won't be any punishments.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.530
My apologies, I'm afraid I can't

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.330
Handing her now won't do me any good.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:33.880
As you see, a failure product like me
doesn't really have much time left.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.670
And then, You and I share the same problem, right?

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.840
What we're dealing with is...

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.970
"How long can I keep my familiars on a short leash?".

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.890
So that's how it is.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.180
You want to see which one of us will break first.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.060
Well, I must say that's worth finding out.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.690
That's very thoughtful.
We're on the same page, then.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.440
But do you still wish to proceed?

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.280
Knowing that even if you defeat me...

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:05.410
You'll still have to destroy Avrora, If you want to stop
the scorched banquet from happening.

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:07.660
So be it, then.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.580
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.920
Despite knowing that,
you're still going to fight me?

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:16.840
You'll need to destroy her
in the end, don't you get it?

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:21.050
In that case, Then I,
I'll use every power at my disposal...

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:22.840
in order to stop you!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.430
No, I won't let you!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.350
Your date is with me.

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:33.350
Zana Rashuka?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.560
Why?

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:38.070
Kii told me this war can't be over yet.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:38.900
Yukina!

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:44.450
Oh my, what a cutie, I dig it.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:47.120
I'll deal with you both at the same time.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.370
Now, show me your moves!

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.960
Didn't I tell you before—

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:58.210
As long as you're still incomplete,
You are no match for me.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.880
Then I'll surely win this battle.

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:08.260
It's useless. I'm the prototype the Fourth Progenitor.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:12.140
Even I was deemed as a failure,
I can exactly copy your moves!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:16.400
Also, if you keep draining your magic like that—

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.610
It'll just pave the way for the scorched banquet to happen.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:25.360
I got you now! The Fourth Progenitor!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:33.830
Avrora, can you hear my voice?

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:47.970
Senior...

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:59.940
This time I will make your wish come true.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:05.940
You'll stay with us, as a student at Saikai Academy.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.110
Together with Asagi, Yaze, Nagisa...

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.280
and also me here!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:30.470
Come forth, Alrescha-Glacies!
Heed my call, Alrescha-Glacies!

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.980
Akatsuki Kojou...

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:46.030
Dear Sis... Why?

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:00.710
Kojou.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.380
We finally meet again!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.960
My soul will always be by your side.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.130
Yeah, it would seem so.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.090
Even so, I'm really glad to see you.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.180
So am I.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:17.060
Even if I have to disappear into thin air,

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:19.430
Meeting you in person like this...

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.690
is the greatest joy for me.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:27.030
No. This time I won't let it happen. I assure you.

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:33.030
However, my body can't escape
from the fate of collapsing.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.500
Forgive me, Avrora.

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.420
Kojou... what are you doing?

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.170
Live, Avrora!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.130
Even If I have to gave up all of my power for that!

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.970
Is it all over?

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.650
Is this the awakening of the true lord of Itogami Island?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.320
The Chief of MAR.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.030
Shafriar Ren!

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:10.150
Bastard!

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:13.110
Found you finally.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.070
Get a load of this, Storm Breaker Axe!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.200
Foolish move.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.120
Tenbu's psychokinesis?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.040
Hey, a gal over there!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.040
Stop that bastard at all costs!

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:29.050
He's breaking the "Keystone Gate" seal!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.130
Breaking seal?

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:34.550
Isn't it time for you to show up, the Fourth Progenitor?

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:38.390
No, former Fourth Progenitor to be exact.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.520
Akatsuki Kojou.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:43.980
Senior?

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:49.360
As expected, Avrora Florestina hasn't disappeared.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:53.900
You chose this girl over the Fourth Progenitor's power.

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:58.330
Is that what you really want? Akatsuki Kojou!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.080
The Overwrite Soul.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.670
He returned all his power back to Avrora
to stop her from disappearing...

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.380
due to being a host without familiar.

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:12.510
He made her the complete the Fourth Progenitor.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:17.340
You gave up the strongest power
in the world just for an artificial girl.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:19.930
What an anticlimatic ending.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:23.180
As for me, I don't really understand what you're thinking.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:24.480
Not that it matters.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:29.020
Fortunately, the plan to resurrect
the true Fourth Progenitor was still a success.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:33.490
For she is an "offering" to the altar called "Itogami Island",

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.820
Her sacrifice will reveal the secret beyond the gate!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.410
An Offering?

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.450
Damn, that dagger...!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:53.300
4 years ago, Avrora was found in a temple located on
an island in the center of the Mediterranean Sea.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:56.550
It wasn't a coincidence that
she would end up in Itogami Island.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.430
Everything went exactly as we planned it in the MAR.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:05.180
There were so many events here that actively hindered...

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:09.400
The complete resurrection of the "Fourth Progenitor",
as the true lord of the Itogami Island.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:16.030
Avrora!

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.450
Damn! Dumblegraff!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.870
You shouldn't be defeated that easily.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.580
The Georgios clan, huh?

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.710
Looks like you went through a lot, Clade.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:32.750
A dragon... Apostles of Order The End?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.500
As promised...

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.380
You dragons! Feast your eyes with your hometown's scenery.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.310
A city in the sky?

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:51.230
This scenery...

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:56.070
A floating artificial island that was
once ruled by The Sinful God Cain.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:59.990
That's the true identity of the world
that you call "The Land of Node"

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:05.620
There's only one who can match the great Cain's magic power,

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:08.330
and connect our world to the Node.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.080
In other words,

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:14.290
The strongest vampire in the world
was created with the power to destroy Cain.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.460
and that is the one and only,
The Fourth Progenitor.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:25.310
What are you really after?! Shafriar Ren!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:29.140
I always hold a grudge against you, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:34.360
As a Tenbu, it's just our nature to be against vampire power.

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:37.400
Human should never posses such power!

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:42.200
That Great Cleansing in the ancient times...

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.990
Had tormented our people by those
with power from "The Land of Node."

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:50.250
My goal has always been about bringing
the world under Tenbu's rule once more.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:53.080
The Blood should've explained all that.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.840
The winner of this Lord's War will
become the ruler of all worlds.

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.970
And there's nothing you can do
to stop it from happening.

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:07.640
You've discarded all of your power as the Fourth Progenitor!

00:22:19.110 --> 00:22:24.990
Before this song ends
Before this song ends

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:31.450
I want to tell you
I want to tell you

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:39.920
I was shy because your kindness
I was shy because your kindness

00:22:41.090 --> 00:22:48.220
I couldn't be honest that day
I couldn't be honest that day

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:55.850
Glare was so bright, I place my hand over my face
Glare was so bright, I place my hand over my face

00:22:56.150 --> 00:23:05.570
Rather than searching for the future we walk together
Rather than searching for the future we walk together

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:12.200
If someday, we can't see each other
If someday, we can't see each other

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:15.500
Until the moment
Until the moment

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:20.800
I want to be by you giving my all of strength
I want to be by you giving my all of strength

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:27.140
With an unnatural and clumsy gesture
With an unnatural and clumsy gesture

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:30.600
You seek me
You seek me

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:36.230
I want to be the only heroin for you
I want to be the only heroin for you

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:41.780
Don't let that melody ends
Don't let that melody ends

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:47.990
The Land of Node, huh?

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:52.160
Quite a nostalgic scenery, right?

00:23:52.830 --> 00:23:57.250
What will you do now, Chaos Bride?

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:58.790
The obvious.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.670
This lord's war will decide who gets to rule over the "Land of Node", won't it?

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:08.930
Perhaps what we really wish is happening, right?

00:24:09.140 --> 00:24:10.510
A "wish", huh?

00:24:11.050 --> 00:24:13.100
What do you mean by that?

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:14.390
Fall Gazer?

00:24:14.770 --> 00:24:18.900
Is it appetency or mischief?

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:25.320
What's going on, Mogwai?
What's that thing in the sky?

00:24:25.320 --> 00:24:27.200
What's the situation with The Lord's war?

00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:31.370
What the heck is this?

00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:36.790
Artificial floating island.
Is it part of the Itogami Island?

00:24:37.710 --> 00:24:40.040
Who's going to make a first move?

00:24:40.330 --> 00:24:43.210
The fate of the world now is in the hand of unknowns.

00:24:43.550 --> 00:24:45.090
That's a lot to deal with.

00:24:47.260 --> 00:24:48.930
Isn't it beautiful, Himeragi?

00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:53.930
I've completely forgot how warm the sunshine is.
It feels really good, right?

00:24:54.100 --> 00:24:56.980
You're really back being a Human.

00:24:57.890 --> 00:24:59.560
But it was really reckless.

00:24:59.810 --> 00:25:03.980
If the "overwrite" weren't successful,
You could've died for real.

00:25:04.270 --> 00:25:05.150
Is that so?

00:25:06.030 --> 00:25:07.360
It is what it is.

00:25:07.900 --> 00:25:11.820
Geez, You really had no choice, didn't you?

00:25:12.450 --> 00:25:14.580
So this is a farewell, huh?

00:25:15.200 --> 00:25:16.700
Thanks for taking good care of me.

00:25:16.950 --> 00:25:17.620
Eh?

00:25:18.540 --> 00:25:21.000
You're the observer of the Fourth Progenitor, right?

00:25:21.830 --> 00:25:24.000
Then you no longer have to stalk me.

00:25:24.590 --> 00:25:26.840
Stalk you?

00:25:27.170 --> 00:25:28.300
Is that how you feel?

00:25:29.130 --> 00:25:33.340
Just so you know, I'll keep staying by your side.

00:25:33.890 --> 00:25:34.640
Why?

00:25:34.760 --> 00:25:36.850
Why do you look dissatisfied?

00:25:37.350 --> 00:25:38.680
Did you forget about this?

00:25:39.100 --> 00:25:41.730
I also can no longer use my power.

00:25:41.810 --> 00:25:44.020
The reason I become your "Blood Servant",

00:25:44.020 --> 00:25:46.440
is to keep my spiritual power in check.

00:25:47.110 --> 00:25:48.820
Oh! I see.

00:25:49.190 --> 00:25:50.700
Then Himeragi...

00:25:50.700 --> 00:25:54.070
Yes, I'm not a "Sword Shaman" anymore.

00:25:54.950 --> 00:25:58.200
Just like you who is no longer
the "Fourth Progenitor".

00:25:59.580 --> 00:26:03.120
Since you're back being a human,

00:26:03.120 --> 00:26:07.920
You're not going to abandon Avrora, right?

00:26:10.840 --> 00:26:15.430
Avrora becomes the Fourth Progenitor
and taken by the 'Land of Node' because of me.

00:26:16.140 --> 00:26:18.930
I won't let her become someone's tool ever again.

00:26:19.770 --> 00:26:22.480
Even if I have to face other Progenitors or even Tenbu...

00:26:23.650 --> 00:26:25.690
I will definitely rescue her.

00:26:27.690 --> 00:26:30.360
From now on, This is my fight!

00:26:32.700 --> 00:26:35.780
No, Senior. This is our fight!

00:26:36.410 --> 00:26:37.490
Himeragi...

00:26:38.200 --> 00:26:39.450
Let's go, Senior.

00:26:42.460 --> 00:26:43.290
Yeah.
